    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oye, ¿podrías ayudarme con algo?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00790065002C002000BF0070006F0064007200ED006100730020006100790075006400610072006D006500200063006F006E00200061006C0067006F003F001000020114012D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mi Audino está un poco raro y no sé qué le pasa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006900200041007500640069006E006F002000650073007400E100200075006E00200070006F0063006F0020007200610072006F002000790020006E006F0020007300E900200071007500E90020006C006500200070006100730061002E001000020114012D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uf... No sé... No deja de tocarme con\nlas antenas.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLos Audino usan las antenas para percibir\nel estado de salud de los demás, tanto el físico<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncomo el psicológico.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPero yo estoy supersaludable. No entiendo\npor qué se empeña en examinarme tanto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 257
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Dino!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100440069006E006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uf... ¿Podrías luchar contra mí? Así Audino verá\nque estoy en buen estado físico.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uf... Avísame cuando estés preparad<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550066002E002E002E00200041007600ED00730061006D00650020006300750061006E0064006F002000650073007400E9007300200070007200650070006100720061006400100003110000FF0101006F0061002E001000020114012D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Podrías combatir contra mi Audino si tienes\nun momento, por favor?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0050006F0064007200ED0061007300200063006F006D0062006100740069007200200063006F006E0074007200610020006D006900200041007500640069006E006F0020007300690020007400690065006E00650073000A0075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F002C00200070006F00720020006600610076006F0072003F001000020114012D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Claro",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006C00610072006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un poco",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E00200070006F0063006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avísame cuando quieras empezar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007600ED00730061006D00650020006300750061006E0064006F0020007100750069006500720061007300200065006D00700065007A00610072002E001000020114012D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uf... Muchas gracias. Bueno... vamos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550066002E002E002E0020004D0075006300680061007300200067007200610063006900610073002E0020004200750065006E006F002E002E002E002000760061006D006F0073002E001000020114012D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me aseguraré de ganar para que Audino\nse convenza de que estoy bien.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500200061007300650067007500720061007200E9002000640065002000670061006E0061007200200070006100720061002000710075006500200041007500640069006E006F000A0073006500200063006F006E00760065006E007A006100200064006500200071007500650020006500730074006F00790020006200690065006E002E001000020114012D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ay, perdimos, ¡pero gracias por el combate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410079002C002000700065007200640069006D006F0073002C002000A1007000650072006F0020006700720061006300690061007300200070006F007200200065006C00200063006F006D00620061007400650021001000020114012D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hacía mucho tiempo que no tenía un combate!\n¡Me siento como nueva!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100480061006300ED00610020006D007500630068006F0020007400690065006D0070006F00200071007500650020006E006F002000740065006E00ED006100200075006E00200063006F006D00620061007400650021000A00A1004D00650020007300690065006E0074006F00200063006F006D006F0020006E00750065007600610021001000020114012D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "♪Din, din.♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "266A00440069006E002C002000640069006E002E266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estaba convencida de estar bien, pero supongo\nque no me daba cuenta de que, en realidad,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nandaba algo estresada.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gracias por darte cuenta, Audino.\n¡Y por hacer que me diera cuenta!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720061006300690061007300200070006F00720020006400610072007400650020006300750065006E00740061002C00200041007500640069006E006F002E000A00A1005900200070006F007200200068006100630065007200200071007500650020006D00650020006400690065007200610020006300750065006E007400610021001000020114012D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "♪¡Din!♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "266A00A100440069006E0021266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je, je... ¡Lo que tú digas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002C0020006A0065002E002E002E002000A1004C006F00200071007500650020007400FA0020006400690067006100730021001000020114012D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La próxima vez que Audino me avise de que algo\nno está bien, le haré caso de inmediato.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
